              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not have egg substitute, I used one full egg and two egg whites. I also used whole wheat bread. My only issue with this recipe was that it wasn't enough to cover six pieces--it was just enough to cover five. Barely. My kids ate all of it. No complaints here."
