              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LdyG33k"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My fiancé and I were wary about a low calorie version of french toast, but I decided to give it a try instead of doing without. Wow! Both of us were foolish for not have trying this sooner!\n\nWe did make some modifications to the original recipe, but we calculated it out to be about 72 calories per piece. Here are our substitutes:\n\n2 eggs\n2/3 cup light Silk soy milk vanilla\nNickles 35 calorie wheat bread\n\nPlease at least give this recipe a fair try if you're looking for a light option.",
